-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The introduction of viscous gel injection in Dr. Sumitz&#39;s </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>orthopaedic clinic in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> improves the knee conditions of the individuals. This procedure is simple, requires no downtime, and the patient can move back to a normal life. The orthopaedic experts inject the viscous fluid into the knee joints and create a lubricant that improves knee functioning. Reduces jerk motions, adds elasticity and viscosity to joints, and eliminates stiffness and pain.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this blog, we are discussing more about &ldquo;viscous gel injection&rdquo; and its benefits and procedures in detail. Read further to learn more about it in detail.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Take a Glimpse Towards the Cons of Knee Replacement Surgery</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Here are the following cons of knee replacement surgery:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Surgical risks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery risks are absurd to overlook because of the infections, blood clots, and anaesthesia of an individual that affect the strength, mobility, and functioning of the body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Recovery Time</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Once the knee replacement surgery occurs, the recovery time takes weeks or months, along with the rehabilitation and physiotherapy for the healing process. In this major time, patients need to have self-commitment for proper recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Pain and discomfort</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery is quite a painful and discomforting experience for individuals, and replacing the natural knee with a prosthetic one takes a toll on the human body, including the pain and discomfort until the proper recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Cost</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The knee replacement surgery procedure puts a heavy load on the wallet because it includes the best-recognised orthopaedic hospital, the cooperation of experts, and the necessary equipment for the whole procedure. The cost may vary depending on the situation and the time spent on it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Stiffness and swelling</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The stiffness and swelling become common once we are done with the knee replacement procedures, and this creates a massive impact on our physical and emotional health.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Nerve and blood vessel damage</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In our body, every small nerve is connected to each other for better information-transmitting function. Once we exclude the internal organ, then the attached nerves and other blood vessels also get damaged altogether. This blood vessel and nerve damage lead to numbness, tingling, and other sensory issues in the leg.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Limited range of motion</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As you change the natural knee, it affects your mobility and the functioning of every part of the body. Due to the pain and stiffness in the bones and joints, the daily walk and even small movements take a toll on the daily lifestyle habits.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">This knee replacement surgery comes with several physical, emotional, and mental health risks. Surgery is the last option when none of the other alternatives work better to handle the knee pain and worn-out knee issues.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">But we have good news for you: </span><strong>Dr.Sumitz</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is introducing the best alternatives to knee replacement surgery. As technology evolves, it will improve your knee health conditions and bring your knees into a better state. Well, let&rsquo;s understand this new, innovative, and non-surgical alternative.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Introducing &ldquo;Viscous Gel Injections&rdquo; For The Healthy Knee, Now At The Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In between our joints, a viscous fluid known as synovial fluid occurs that improves the functioning and mobility of the joints. This viscous gel helps to reduce friction and any kind of jerk during the movements.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">But as we grow older, the consistency of the synovial fluid gets reduced in our bones and joints. The time also comes in an individual&#39;s life when the fluid becomes negligible, leading to pain and issues for the individual.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Let&rsquo;s see the benefits of viscous gel injections instead of knee replacement surgery. -</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Joint lubrication</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The viscous gel injection contains hylauronic acid-based gel, which acts as a lubricant that improves mobility and the functioning of joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Pain relief</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscous gel injections provide relief from bone and joint pain by cushioning and protecting the affected area. Pain may occur due to multiple reasons, and we have a one-stop solution in the form of viscous gel injections.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Improved joint function</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The pain during walking, sitting, and bending down&mdash;all issues&mdash;can be improved with the help of a viscous gel injection. As the fluid restores its viscosity and improves the elasticity of the bones and joints. This leads to smoother functioning of the body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Non-surgical option</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Are you looking for a non-surgical option in place of knee replacement surgery? Then viscous gel injection is the best non-surgical option that will improve your bone and joint health without undergoing major surgery procedures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>No side effects</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery is a major risk because of the side effects after the procedure. But it is probably impossible when it comes to the viscous gel injections, and it improves the bone and health conditions for the overall well-being experience.&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Procedures for Viscous Gel Injection</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Before heading towards the procedure, it is important to note that it is not a simple procedure and must be done under the supervision of experienced orthopaedic experts and the orthopaedic clinic or hospital.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The following are the steps and procedures that the medical facility&#39;s supervision must adhere to:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Consultation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The treatment provider takes a quick call with the patient to learn about their current health conditions, suitability of viscous gel injections, and past medical history.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Treatment process</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The target joint needs to be cleansed, and using a fine, sterilised needle, the viscous gel is injected into the joint of the patient.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Follow up</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Once it is done, the doctor suggests some precautions that need to be taken and also takes a follow-up to assess the patient&#39;s situation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Recovery and rehabilitation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For recovery and rehabilitation, the patient needs to quit heavy lifting and other strenuous activities for some time. Physiotherapy and other motion activities promote speedy recovery and foster well-being.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Playing with your granddaughter and participating in activities in the 70s or 80s is no longer a dream. As technology evolves, the medical industry introduces new treatments and practices that bring ease and well-being to the lives of patients. Instead of relying on medication and surgical-based treatment, now is the time to try physiotherapy and non-surgical-based treatment, especially viscous gel injections. These kinds of treatments have no age bar and are suitable for everyone. Are you looking for non-surgical-based treatments? Then</span><strong> Dr. Sumitz</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is the one-stop solution that welcomes ease and a pain-free life. It&#39;s time to celebrate the best version of yourself and witness the real-life transformation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/136406769_18_01_2024_04_08_11.jpg','2023-12-29 07:53:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27',NULL),(109,'viscose-gel-injections-navigating-the-dos-and-donts-for-optimal-results-in-bone-and-joints-pain','Viscose Gel Injections: Navigating The Do\'s And Don\'ts For Optimal Results In Bone And Joints Pain ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','In order to maintain the luxury of life, we overlook most of our gratitude. One of them is an individual with a healthy body. A pain-free life is what...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In order to maintain the luxury of life, we overlook most of our gratitude. One of them is an individual with a healthy body. A pain-free life is what every individual aims for, and achieving the same will be like reaching a milestone.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Age is just a number, and as the number increases, we gradually find changes in our body. Changes like limited mobility, fatigue, low stamina, and anxiety to not participate in other physical activities. Most patients think of knee surgery to eliminate the pain, but they might be unaware of the new medical revolution for knee pain. Viscose gel injection, hyaluronic gel injection, or viscosupplementation are the common names for this procedure. Hyaluronic acid provides lubrication for the knee and minimises the progression of osteoarthritis. It is a minimally invasive procedure, improves quality of life, and also increases the time span of joint pain.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is a Viscose Gel Injection?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Viscose gel injection<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is a minimal, non-invasive kind of treatment that orthopaedic doctors perform to avoid pain in bones and joints. Viscose gel injection is also known as viscosupplementation or hyaluronic acid injection. Patients with knee arthritis are the qualified ones to try this injection for the arthritis pain. The doctor injects this injection into the affected or pain-causing area and gets relief from the pain.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Today, cellulose gel injections bring a revolution to the medical industry and allow patients to achieve a smooth transition to a pain-free life. To know more about the procedures, the overall benefits, and the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>best orthopaedic clinic in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> where you can look for this treatment, keep reading, as we are uncovering each and every point.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Let&#39;s do a deep dive into the pre- and post-treatment procedures of cellulose gel injections.</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Here are the pre- and post-treatment procedures for a Viscose Gel Injection:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Pre-procedure of Viscose Gel Injections</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Before taking your first step towards a vapour gel injection, get a proper consultation from a reliable orthopaedic doctor. He will help you make the right decision, whether you go for it or not.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">After the consultation, the doctor takes a physical examination to review the current situation of your body and determine whether you are a good fit or not.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">To get better insight, they can ask for X-rays, MRIs, and scans for the optimum results after injections.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Procedure&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">During this procedure, the doctor carefully injects the viscose gel injection into the affected knee or joint, and then it requires multiple visits to attain the optimum results.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Post-Procedure of Viscose Gel Injections</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Viscose gel injection is a highly effective pain-relieving treatment, which is why it does not require enough time to recover after the treatment.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Instead of indulging your body in strenuous activities post-treatment, you can get back to your normal life.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">One injection is not enough, and that is why you can have multiple follow-ups with the doctor for the optimum results.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>What are the pros and cons of the Viscose Gel Injection?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After pre- and post-treatment procedures, now is the time to learn about the pros and cons of a gel injection.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Pros of Viscose Gel Injections</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This is a non-surgical treatment, and anyone can have this treatment without paying enough from their wallet.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Viscose gel injections have minimal side effects that nullify your pain and improve mobility.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The whole magic is in hyaluronic acid, which improves the consistency of synovial fluid in joints and potentially reduces friction and pain.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Undergoing <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/viscosupplementation-injection-treatment-pune\"><strong>viscosupplementation treatment </strong></a>means patients can relieve their </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/knee-arthritis\"><strong>knee pain</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> more promptly.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This is a quick procedure that will not affect your daily routine. In just half an hour, you can be free from the viscose gel injection treatment.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Cons of Viscose Gel Injections</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscose gel injection also requires utmost attention to detail in the whole procedure. The only cons of having viscosupplementation are that if it is not done under expert supervision, complications can occur.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>How long will it take to inject Viscose Gel?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The time span during the Viscose Gel Injection depends on multiple factors, like the number of injections used, duration of treatment, follow-up visits, frequency of injections, health concerns, and type of clinic you are going to for treatment. The time duration may be extended or minimised based on the patient&#39;s present health situation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>What is the price of a vapour gel injection?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The price of the Viscose Gel Injection will be around 14000 INR, so always choose a high-quality treatment for better results. Pricing depends on multiple factors, including the location, the patient&rsquo;s current health concerns, and much more. We can&rsquo;t predict the same price every year, so it is crucial to not just make up your mind to see just one price.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Where should I visit for a viscose gel injection in Pune?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">On the market, there are multiple options available for the viscose gel injection. This is prior to doing their own research and looking for the</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">best orthopaedic clinic in Pune that can help them provide remium-quality&nbsp; treatment. If you are suffering from knee ailments and want to get rid of them through a venous gel injection, then </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is the best orthopaedic clinic in Pune for the best results.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">With the cooperative efforts of expert orthopedic doctors, they offer highly effective, customized, cost effective, and premium quality treatment to the patient for a smooth transition.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscose Gel Injections are state of the art medical services that are provided to the patient for their better knee health. If you are not willing to choose painful knee surgery for the pain, then this alternative will be a great help. Minimally invasive, no side effects, quick and easy recovery, avoiding time consumption, and being cost effective are the advantages of this treatment. With the assistance of Dr. Sumitz and their </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\"><strong>best orthopedic doctors team in Pune</strong></a><strong>,</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> you can navigate through the journey of an ailment-free knee. </span></p>\r\n','uploads/product/376753828_18_01_2024_04_07_22.jpg','2024-01-06 12:26:52','2026-07-14 08:35:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27',NULL),(110,'joint-rejuvenation-here-is-why-you-should-go-for-viscose-gel-injection-treatment','Joint Rejuvenation: Here is why you should go for Viscose Gel Injection Treatment','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Viscose gel injections set foot in the lives of arthritis patients as magic because they have the potential to turn misery into pleasure.\r\n\r\nBeing old...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscose gel injections set foot in the lives of arthritis patients as magic because they have the potential to turn misery into pleasure.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Being older comes with lots of challenges, including resistance to mobility, persistent pain, and inflammation in the knee. This kind of problem takes a toll on the mental and physical health of a patient and makes them not capable enough to embrace the beauty of life. With the help of groundbreaking innovations in the medical realm, you can now step into your desired life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscose gel injections come up as a breakthrough and reshape the landscape of joint-related disabilities. Hylauronic acid is the main catalyst for this treatment, and it helps in shock abosorption and supplies the flow of lubrication in the joints to improve movement and functioning. For the knee arthritis patient and osteoarthritis patient, this is a boon for a patient. In this blog, we are going to unveil the benefits of viscose gel injection treatment and how you can kickstart the journey towards healthy well-being.</span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Benefits of VISCOSE GEL INJECTION Treatment</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscosupplementation treatment is a gel-based treatment that brings relief from the pain of the knee and joint. Here, we are sharing the benefits of a viscose gel injection for your knee arthritis.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Improved lubrication and cushioning</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As an individual gets older, the lubrication between the knee joints gets reduced. At that stage, the probability of replenishing again is almost impossible, and that is why we need alternatives. Viscose gel injections come up as a lifesaver and fulfil the necessity of the natural synovial fluid in joints. It absorbs the shock and promotes smoother joint movements in almost every daily activity.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Long-lasting Relief</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pain takes a toll on the mental and physical health of an individual. To bring a smooth transition into your life, a viscose gel injection is all you need. This injection prevents you from experiencing knee pain that awakens you the whole night and fosters sustainable and healthy well-being.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Reduced inflammation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Unlike other traditional gel-based treatments, viscose gel injection is far better. Because it doesn&rsquo;t allow the patient to leave them in pain or inflammation. In hyaluronic acid gel, you will find anti-inflammatory properties that ease pain.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Enhanced mobility</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Once you have done the viscose gel injection treatment, it enhances mobility and fosters flexibility in joints during motion. The stiffness of joints and the limited range of motion are the common issues that disallow comfort in movement. With viscose gel injection, you can now experience ease of movement without losing zeal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Minimally invasive and tolerable</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery can be invasive and intolerable for an older person. But there is nothing to be worried about with the viscose gel injection-based treatment. This is minimally invasive and not even painful like other traditional treatments. Viscose gel-based injections may happen in an outpatient setting, so you can resume your lifestyle the next day.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>A personalised treatment approach</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">A personalised treatment plan can never be out of choice, and it is one of the favourite things for any patient. In a viscose gel-based injection, the treatment will be based on the needs and condition of each patient. The personalised treatment plan will help you not resist more in bed and have a quick recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Conjunction with other treatments</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Viscose gel-based injections are used in conjunction with other treatments, and they can be used to improve knee pain</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">and encourage mobility and functioning. Along with pain medication and physiotherapy, this can be a comprehensive approach to </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/knee-arthritis\"><strong>knee pain treatment</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">T