earliest signs of discomfort can prevent minor issues from becoming severe problems.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Signs You Should Visit a Spine Specialist</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Many people delay seeking medical attention until pain becomes unbearable. However, early diagnosis often leads to better outcomes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consider visiting a <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/why-neck-and-shoulder-pain-should-not-be-ignored-expert-insights-from-dr-sumitz-clinic\"><strong>Spine specialist in Bane</strong></a>r if you experience:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Persistent back pain lasting more than a few weeks</li>\r\n	<li>Neck pain that radiates to the shoulders or arms</li>\r\n	<li>Numbness or tingling in the legs</li>\r\n	<li>Difficulty standing or walking for long periods</li>\r\n	<li>Reduced flexibility and spinal movement</li>\r\n	<li>Frequent muscle weakness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>At Dr SumitZ Baner, patients receive a thorough evaluation to identify the root cause of pain rather than simply treating symptoms.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Comprehensive Spine Care at Dr SumitZ Clinic</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>As a trusted spine care center in Baner, Dr SumitZ Clinic focuses on non-surgical and surgical treatment approaches depending on the patient&#39;s condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Advanced Diagnosis</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Accurate diagnosis is the foundation of effective treatment. The clinic uses detailed clinical examinations and imaging assessments to understand the exact cause of discomfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Personalized Pain Management</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Being recognized as a reliable spine and pain center in Baner, the clinic offers individualized treatment plans that may include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Physiotherapy</li>\r\n	<li>Medication management</li>\r\n	<li>Lifestyle modifications</li>\r\n	<li>Posture correction</li>\r\n	<li>Rehabilitation programs</li>\r\n	<li>Exercise therapy</li>\r\n	<li>Expert Orthopedic Consultation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients looking for an orthopedic spine doctor, best orthopedic spine specialist near me, or an experienced <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/7-habits-causing-back-pain-in-pune-working-professionals-explained-by-dr-sumitz\"><strong>orthopedic surgeon Baner</strong></a> can benefit from specialized care aimed at restoring mobility and reducing pain effectively.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>The Role of Exercise in Spine Health</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Exercise is one of the most effective ways to strengthen the muscles supporting the spine and reduce recurring pain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One commonly recommended movement is the spine extension exercise, which helps improve flexibility, posture, and spinal alignment. When performed under professional supervision, spine extension exercises can:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Reduce lower back stiffness</li>\r\n	<li>Improve posture</li>\r\n	<li>Strengthen spinal muscles</li>\r\n	<li>Support recovery from certain spine conditions</li>\r\n	<li>Enhance mobility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>However, it is important to consult a cervical spine doctor or spine specialist before starting any exercise routine, especially if you have chronic pain or an existing spinal condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Non-Surgical Treatment Options for Spine Pain</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Many patients assume surgery is the only solution for severe back pain. In reality, a large percentage of spine conditions can be managed without surgery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At Dr SumitZ Clinic, non-surgical treatment options may include:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Customized physiotherapy programs help improve flexibility, muscle strength, and posture while reducing pain naturally.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Pain Management Techniques</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Targeted pain management therapies can provide significant relief from chronic discomfort and improve overall functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Lifestyle and Ergonomic Guidance</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Simple changes in sitting posture, workstation setup, sleeping positions, and daily habits can make a major difference in long-term spine health.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>When Surgery May Be Necessary?&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Although non-surgical treatments are highly effective in many cases, some conditions may require surgical intervention.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A consultation with a <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/contact-us\"><strong>best ortho spine doctor</strong></a> may be recommended if you have:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Severe nerve compression</li>\r\n	<li>Significant spinal instability</li>\r\n	<li>Progressive neurological symptoms</li>\r\n	<li>Chronic pain that does not respond to conservative treatment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The goal is always to explore the least invasive treatment options first while ensuring the best possible outcome for the patient.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Dr SumitZ Clinic for Spine Care?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients across Baner, Balewadi, and Pune trust Dr SumitZ Baner because of:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Comprehensive spine evaluations</li>\r\n	<li>Personalized treatment plans</li>\r\n	<li>Focus on non-surgical recovery</li>\r\n	<li>Advanced pain management solutions</li>\r\n	<li>Experienced orthopedic and spine care expertise</li>\r\n	<li>Patient-centered approach</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you&#39;re looking for a back doctor near you, an orthopedic spine specialist in Baner, or a trusted Spine specialist in Baner, Dr SumitZ Clinic provides complete care designed to improve your quality of life and help you return to your daily activities with confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Spine health plays a crucial role in maintaining mobility, comfort, and overall well-being. Ignoring neck or back pain can lead to long-term complications, making early diagnosis and treatment essential. Whether you need expert consultation, pain management, physiotherapy, or advanced orthopedic care, Dr SumitZ Clinic offers comprehensive spine care solutions tailored to your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Phone: +91 9545559434<br />\r\nMail: drgsumit@gmail.com<br />\r\nWebsite: <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\">www.drsumitz.com</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><br />\r\nFrequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. When should I consult a spine doctor?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You should consult a spine specialist if you experience persistent neck pain, back pain, numbness, tingling sensations, or reduced mobility that lasts for more than a few weeks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Can spine pain be treated without surgery?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes. Most spine conditions can be managed effectively through physiotherapy, medications, posture correction, lifestyle changes, and rehabilitation programs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. What does a spine extension exercise do?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A spine extension exercise helps improve spinal flexibility, strengthen supporting muscles, reduce stiffness, and promote better posture when performed correctly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. How do I find the best orthopedic spine specialist near me?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Look for experienced specialists who offer comprehensive diagnosis, personalized treatment plans, and a combination of surgical and non-surgical treatment options, such as those available at Dr SumitZ Clinic.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. What conditions does a cervical spine doctor treat?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A cervical spine doctor treats neck pain, cervical spondylosis, slipped discs in the neck region, nerve compression, and other conditions affecting the cervical spine.</p>\r\n','uploads/product/942646781_22_06_2026_05_43_17.webp','2026-06-22 09:20:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27',NULL),(199,'how-to-choose-the-best-orthopedic-doctor-in-pune-a-complete-patient-guide-dr-sumitz-clinic','How to Choose the Best Orthopedic Doctor in Pune: A Complete Patient Guide | Dr. Sumitz Clinic','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','When it comes to bone, joint, muscle, or spine problems, choosing the best orthopedic doctor in Pune&nbsp;can make a significant difference in your re...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">When it comes to bone, joint, muscle, or spine problems, choosing the </span><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;can make a significant difference in your recovery and long-term health. Whether you&#39;re dealing with persistent knee pain, a sports injury, arthritis, back pain, or a fracture, consulting the right orthopedic specialist ensures an accurate diagnosis and an effective treatment plan.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">With several specialists available across the city, many patients often wonder how to identify the </span><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> for their specific condition. This guide will help you understand the important factors to consider before making your decision.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Why Choosing the Right Orthopedic Doctor Matters?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Orthopedic conditions often affect your mobility, comfort, and overall quality of life. Delaying treatment or choosing an inexperienced specialist can result in prolonged pain and slower recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A skilled </span><strong>orthopedic doctor Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;focuses not only on treating symptoms but also on identifying the root cause of the problem. The right doctor will recommend the most suitable treatment, whether it involves medication, physiotherapy, minimally invasive procedures, or surgery only when absolutely necessary.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">At </span><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, patient-focused care, advanced diagnostic techniques, and personalized treatment plans help individuals recover faster while improving their overall mobility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"best orthopedic doctor Pune\" src=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/public/uploads/category/420833720_02_11_2022_04_39_40.jpg\" style=\"height:327px; width:499px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Qualities to Look for in the Best Orthopedic Doctor Pune</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>1. Experience and Specialization</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Experience is one of the most important factors when selecting an <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/specialists\"><strong>orthopedic specialist</strong></a>. Different orthopedic doctors specialize in different areas such as:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Knee and Hip Disorders</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Shoulder and Sports Injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Spine Problems</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Arthritis Treatment</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Fracture Management</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint Replacement Surgery</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Choosing an experienced specialist increases the chances of receiving the right diagnosis and treatment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>2. Modern Diagnostic Approach</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> uses advanced diagnostic methods to evaluate your condition accurately. Proper clinical examinations combined with imaging techniques help create a customized treatment plan instead of relying on temporary pain relief.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>3. Conservative Treatment First</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Not every orthopedic condition requires surgery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">An experienced </span><strong>orthopedic doctor Baner</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> will always explore non-surgical treatment options like:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Physiotherapy</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lifestyle modifications</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Medication</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Exercise programs</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint injections (when appropriate)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Surgery is generally recommended only when conservative treatments fail to provide relief.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>4. Positive Patient Reviews</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Patient experiences provide valuable insights into a doctor&#39;s expertise, communication skills, and treatment outcomes.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">When searching for the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments\"><strong>best orthopedic doctor near me</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, look for consistent reviews mentioning:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Accurate diagnosis</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Friendly consultation</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Transparent treatment plans</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Successful recovery</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Excellent patient support</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>5. Convenient Location</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Follow-up appointments are often essential for orthopedic recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Choosing an </span><strong>orthopedic in Baner</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> offers convenience for patients living in Baner, Balewadi, Aundh, Pashan, and nearby areas. Easy accessibility encourages timely follow-ups and smoother rehabilitation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"best orthopedic doctor Pune\" src=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/public/uploads/category/949891714_03_11_2022_03_21_36.jpg\" style=\"height:327px; width:499px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Common Conditions Treated by an Orthopedic Doctor</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A qualified </span><strong>orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;can diagnose and treat a wide variety of musculoskeletal conditions, including:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Knee pain</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Hip pain</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Shoulder injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Frozen shoulder</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Back pain</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Neck pain</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Sports injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Arthritis</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Fractures</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Ligament injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Tendon disorders</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint stiffness</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Osteoporosis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Early consultation often prevents minor conditions from becoming chronic problems.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Why Patients Choose Dr. Sumitz Clinic?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Patients looking for the </span><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> often prefer </span><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> because of its patient-centric approach and comprehensive orthopedic care.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Some of the reasons include:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Personalized treatment plans</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Comprehensive orthopedic consultations</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Advanced diagnostic evaluation</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Focus on non-surgical treatment whenever possible</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Expert management of joint, spine, and sports injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Guidance on rehabilitation and long-term recovery</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Every patient receives individualized attention, ensuring treatment is tailored according to age, activity level, lifestyle, and overall health condition.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>When Should You Visit an Orthopedic Specialist?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You should consult an </span><strong>orthopedic doctor near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> if you experience:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Persistent joint pain lasting more than a few weeks</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Difficulty walking or climbing stairs</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Swelling around joints</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Limited movement</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Recurrent sports injuries</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Bone fractures</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Back or neck pain affecting daily activities</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Shoulder pain that doesn&#39;t improve with rest</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Ignoring these symptoms can worsen the condition and delay recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Is Dr. Sumitz Clinic Among the Top Choices in Pune?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Many patients searching online for the </span><strong>top 10 orthopedic doctors in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> prioritize experience, patient satisfaction, and personalized treatment over rankings alone.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">At </span><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, patients receive evidence-based orthopedic care with an emphasis on restoring mobility, reducing pain, and helping individuals return to their active lifestyle as quickly as possible.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Similarly, those looking for the </span><strong>top 10 orthopedic doctors near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> often value accessible care, transparent communication, and long-term treatment support&mdash;all of which are central to the clinic&#39;s philosophy.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Final Remarks</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Finding the </span><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;involves more than simply choosing the nearest clinic. Experience, accurate diagnosis, patient-centered care, modern treatment methods, and long-term rehabilitation all play a crucial role in successful recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Whether you&#39;re suffering from joint pain, sports injuries, arthritis, or spine-related issues, </span><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> is committed to providing comprehensive orthopedic care that prioritizes your health, mobility, and quality of life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Book your consultation today and take the first step toward pain-free movement.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Phone:</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> +91 9545559434</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mail:</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> Drgsumit@gmail.com</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Website:</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> https://drsumitz.com</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>1. How do I choose the best orthopedic doctor in Pune?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Look for experience, specialization, patient reviews, treatment approach, modern diagnostic facilities, and personalized care. These factors help you find the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/why-orthopedic-care-is-essential-for-long-term-bone-joint-health-dr-sumitz\"><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> for your specific condition.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>2. When should I visit an orthopedic doctor?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You should consult an </span><strong>orthopedic doctor Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;if you experience persistent joint pain, fractures, sports injuries, back pain, neck pain, or reduced mobility that affects your daily routine.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>3. Does every orthopedic problem require surgery?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">No. Most orthopedic conditions can be managed with <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>physiotherapy</strong></a>, medications, lifestyle changes, and rehabilitation. Surgery is recommended only when conservative treatments are not effective.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>4. Why should I choose an orthopedic doctor in Baner?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">An experienced </span><strong>orthopedic doctor Baner</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> offers convenient access for patients in Baner and surrounding areas while providing comprehensive diagnosis, treatment, and follow-up care for various orthopedic conditions.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>5. What conditions are treated at Dr. Sumitz Clinic?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> treats knee pain, arthritis, sports injuries, fractures, shoulder disorders, spine problems, back pain, neck pain, ligament injuries, joint stiffness, and various other musculoskeletal conditions using personalized treatment plans.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/207377475_09_07_2026_01_06_22.jpeg','2026-07-09 07:27:42','2026-07-14 08:35:27','2026-07-14 08:35:27',NULL);
